  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 618 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D7"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Ketamine hydrochloride is not on FDA's current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; FDA's history shows an earlier shortage first posted on 2018-02-16, since resolved.",
      "cites": ["D13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 976095 at Hospira, Inc. ended 2016-06-08 and was classified OAI, 618 days before the 2018-02-16 posting.",
      "cites": ["D7", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to Hospira, Inc. on 2017-02-14, 367 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["D8", "E19"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1031233 at Hospira, Inc. ended 2017-10-27 and was classified VAI, 112 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["D9", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 39 vials of the 50 mg/mL, 10 mL presentation at 7.2 vials per day, giving 5.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 126 vials of the same presentation at 7.7 vials per day, giving 16.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to transfer 18 vials of 50 mg/mL, 10 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would leave Corvale General with 14 days and bring Corvale East to 8 days.",
      "cites": ["D14"]
    }
  ]
}
